		(title "10-LED Matrix Array - RainLight")
		(rev "1.2")
		(comment 1 "Rev 1.2: fixed LED polarity (all D1-D10 were reverse-biased), replaced")
		(comment 2 "shared R1/150R + R2/10k with individual per-LED resistors R1-R10 (1.2k,")
		(comment 3 "sized for red/amber LEDs at automotive 12-14.4V). Rebuilt VCC/GND buses as")
		(comment 4 "true endpoint-to-endpoint segments so all 10 rows are actually connected.")
